WEBVTT

00:49:27.458 --> 00:49:31.109
KFL: Well, it would include telemarketing,

00:49:31.133 --> 00:49:34.156
telesales, customer service,

00:49:34.180 --> 00:49:37.172
cashier, back-office processing,

00:49:37.196 --> 00:49:40.776
data entry, truck driver, chauffeur.

00:49:40.800 --> 00:49:43.190
It would include assembly line work,

00:49:43.214 --> 00:49:48.444
fruit picking and all kinds
of routine, repetitive work.

00:49:48.468 --> 00:49:50.825
Because routine, repetitive work

00:49:50.849 --> 00:49:56.562
doesn't require, generally,
a lot of creativity.

00:49:56.586 --> 00:50:00.675
And also don't relate
to a human connection